"Read current-task output, or retained in-memory transcript with full=true (not necessarily complete history). The current task's final answer is returned whole, in pages of up to 40000 chars: a longer answer carries a header with its total size, this page's range and the next offset to pass. offset/limit (chars) select a page. While a worker is still working, returns bounded recent tool activity instead of a final answer. full=true puts any snapshot path first and the final answer (when it fits) before the retained items; every result stays under 47000 chars. sessionFile identifies canonical history when available; otherwise sessionId identifies the backend session."
